#after garden tutorial, your mom tells you where to plant a garden
if {tringarden} == true
	Kai: I saw you talked to, Trin. How'd that go?
	Te: I'm growing on her. 
	Kai: She does like stuff that grows. What's that?
	Te: Seeds. I wanna make a garden like, Trin. If I can find space for it. 
	Kai: Try the roof. Closer access to the sun and it'll absorb rain water. A win win all around. 
	Te: I get to play on the roof! Awesome!
	Kai: I didn't say play--Te!
